  FontColor->RGBColor[0, 0.5, 0]],
 "the decoder is causal: output i does not change when later output positions \
change"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"50f5e422-3a0c-4aa6-8b34-5ecc3b69ac89"],

Cell["9. Shared embeddings, multiplied by \[Sqrt]dmodel", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"9a5e0792-71ba-444e-a66e-0a1edfc6841a"],

Cell["\<\
The paper uses one weight matrix for the input embedding, the output \
embedding and the projection before the softmax, and multiplies the \
embeddings by \[Sqrt]dmodel (Section 3.4). In Wolfram the sharing is \
NetSharedArray: EmbeddingLayer stores a V\[Times]d matrix, and LinearLayer[V] \
on d-dimensional inputs stores a V\[Times]d matrix as well, so one array \
serves both.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"20b8454b-dc32-4e19-8ae7-be9220182c35"],

Cell["\<\
EmbeddingLayer[d, V, \"Weights\" -> NetSharedArray[\"W\"]]   \[Ellipsis]   \
LinearLayer[V, \"Weights\" -> NetSharedArray[\"W\"]]\
\>", "Program",ExpressionUUID->"5c39fb43-9d17-47be-9eae-a7a8e8e84394"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["PASS  ",
  FontWeight->Bold,
  FontColor->RGBColor[0, 0.5, 0]],
 "the embedding and the output projection are one and the same array"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"460e0549-1ebb-42e1-a26e-d9992a63b4c3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["PASS  ",
  FontWeight->Bold,
  FontColor->RGBColor[0, 0.5, 0]],
 "the net stores that array once: 160 shared weights and 20 output biases"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"be2a6e49-cfea-4f71-9949-60d21ef18e07"],

Cell["10. Label smoothing", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"2db7dd42-4542-4b67-ab09-b0dfe71de4c6"],

Cell["\<\
The training target is not one-hot: with \[Epsilon] = 0.1 and K classes it \
puts (1\[Minus]\[Epsilon]) + \[Epsilon]/K on the right class and \[Epsilon]/K \
on each of the others. The model learns to be less sure; the paper reports \
that this hurts perplexity but improves accuracy and BLEU (Section 5.4).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ef7ea24d-e7b2-40f6-bf0d-c6fea42a6c01"],

Cell["q = (1\[Minus]\[Epsilon]) onehot(y) + \[Epsilon]/K ,     loss = \
\[Minus]\[CapitalSigma] q log p", "Program",ExpressionUUID->"b8268ead-811a-\
4991-bbae-58a9ed2b4450"],

